# Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# Leave VITE_API_URL empty so the Vite dev server proxy (defined in vite.config.js)
# forwards '/api' requests directly to http://127.0.0.1:5000.
#
# PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT (Vercel, Netlify, Render Static Site, etc.):
# Set this to the full URL of your deployed Express backend (without a trailing slash):
# Example:
VITE_API_URL=https://bhudan-server.onrender.com
